    <p class="sj-note">This panel is explanatory context. It is <b>not counted</b> in the {{ C.counts.inherited }} descriptions and never changes a denominator.</p>
    <p>The {{ C.counts.inherited }} descriptions are about God’s attributes. They do not, by themselves, settle the question most people ask first: is God one being in three persons, or three persons one in purpose? That question belongs to the structure of the Godhead, and this panel addresses it directly, outside the count.</p>
